    <skos:altLabel>data tostatura</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Certification">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Certification</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Certificazione e audit di una Farm secondo la Fourth Hand Standard. Una Farm è in regola alla data D se ha una Certification con ValidFrom &lt;= D &lt;= ValidTo e SuspendedFrom vuoto oppure successivo a D. CertStatus è lo stato ATTUALE, non lo stato a una data passata: per verificare la conformità a una data usare sempre ValidFrom, ValidTo e SuspendedFrom.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>certificazione</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>audit</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>certificato</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>stato di conformità</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Farm_FarmName">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>FarmName</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Farm"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Nome del produttore.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>nome farm</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>nome produttore</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Farm_FarmRegion">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>FarmRegion</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Farm"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Regione di coltivazione.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>regione di origine</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Farm">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Farm</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Il produttore (farmer) che coltiva il caffè: la prima delle quattro mani. Un GreenLot può contenere caffè di più Farm. Per sapere se una Farm era in regola a una certa data si guardano le sue Certification (relazione holdsCertification). Fourth Hand Standard: Fourth Coffee acquista caffè verde solo da produttori in regola il giorno dell'acquisto. Un GreenLot è conforme solo se OGNI Farm che lo rifornisce (relazione supplies), qualunque sia la sua quota, alla data PurchaseDate del lotto aveva una Certification con ValidFrom &lt;= PurchaseDate &lt;= ValidTo e con SuspendedFrom vuoto oppure successivo a PurchaseDate. Basta una sola Farm non in regola per rendere non conforme l'intero lotto. Una sospensione non rende non conformi i lotti acquistati prima della data di sospensione. Le certificazioni vengono sospese quando l'audit qualità non è superato (per esempio difetti di fermentazione del caffè verde, che danno un gusto acido in tazza). I lotti non conformi ancora in magazzino (WarehouseStatus = InStock) vanno messi in attesa e segnalati al team sourcing.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>produttore</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>farmer</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>fattoria</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>piantagione</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>finca</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>coltivatore</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/GreenLot">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>GreenLot</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Lotto di caffè verde (non tostato) acquistato da Fourth Coffee: è il «lotto» nel linguaggio del sourcing. Mescola chicchi di una o più Farm (relazione supplies, con quota percentuale nella tabella green_lot_farms). Non confonderlo con RoastBatch (lotto di tostatura) né con PackagingRun (lotto di confezionamento). Quando qualcuno chiede «da quale lotto viene il caffè» riferendosi all'origine, intende il GreenLot. Fourth Hand Standard: Fourth Coffee acquista caffè verde solo da produttori in regola il giorno dell'acquisto. Un GreenLot è conforme solo se OGNI Farm che lo rifornisce (relazione supplies), qualunque sia la sua quota, alla data PurchaseDate del lotto aveva una Certification con ValidFrom &lt;= PurchaseDate &lt;= ValidTo e con SuspendedFrom vuoto oppure successivo a PurchaseDate. Basta una sola Farm non in regola per rendere non conforme l'intero lotto. Una sospensione non rende non conformi i lotti acquistati prima della data di sospensione. Le certificazioni vengono sospese quando l'audit qualità non è superato (per esempio difetti di fermentazione del caffè verde, che danno un gusto acido in tazza). I lotti non conformi ancora in magazzino (WarehouseStatus = InStock) vanno messi in attesa e segnalati al team sourcing.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>green lot</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>lotto verde</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>lotto di caffè verde</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>lotto di acquisto</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>partita di caffè verde</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Certification_ValidFrom">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>ValidFrom</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Certification"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Inizio validità della certificazione.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>valida dal</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Farm_holdsCertification_Certification">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>holdsCertification</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Farm"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Certification"/>
    <rdfs:comment>La Farm possiede questa Certification.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>ha certificazione</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>certificata da</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label>FourthCoffee</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Ontologia di Fourth Coffee: la catena che porta il caffè dalla farm alla tazzina (Farm -&gt; GreenLot -&gt; RoastBatch -&gt; PackagingRun -&gt; Shipment -&gt; Store), le macchine installate nei negozi e i reclami dei clienti. Fourth Hand Standard: Fourth Coffee acquista caffè verde solo da produttori in regola il giorno dell'acquisto. Un GreenLot è conforme solo se OGNI Farm che lo rifornisce (relazione supplies), qualunque sia la sua quota, alla data PurchaseDate del lotto aveva una Certification con ValidFrom &lt;= PurchaseDate &lt;= ValidTo e con SuspendedFrom vuoto oppure successivo a PurchaseDate. Basta una sola Farm non in regola per rendere non conforme l'intero lotto. Una sospensione non rende non conformi i lotti acquistati prima della data di sospensione. Le certificazioni vengono sospese quando l'audit qualità non è superato (per esempio difetti di fermentazione del caffè verde, che danno un gusto acido in tazza). I lotti non conformi ancora in magazzino (WarehouseStatus = InStock) vanno messi in attesa e segnalati al team sourcing.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/PackagingRun_shippedWith_Shipment">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>shippedWith</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/PackagingRun"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Shipment"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Il PackagingRun è stato spedito con questa Shipment.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>spedito con</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Certification_CertificationId">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>CertificationId</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Certification"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Codice univoco della certificazione.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/GreenLot_MoisturePct">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>MoisturePct</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/GreenLot"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Umidità del caffè verde in percentuale.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>umidità</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Shipment_ShipmentId">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>ShipmentId</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Shipment"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Codice univoco della spedizione.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>codice spedizione</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Complaint">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Complaint</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Un reclamo di un cliente in un negozio. ComplaintCategory distingue per esempio «Gusto acido», «Gusto amaro», «Temperatura», «Servizio lento», «Errore ordine».</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>reclamo</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>lamentela</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>segnalazione cliente</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>feedback negativo</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Shipment_ShipDate">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>ShipDate</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Shipment"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Data di partenza della spedizione.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>data spedizione</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Complaint_ComplaintText">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>ComplaintText</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Complaint"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Testo del reclamo.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>testo</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Store_StoreFormat">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>StoreFormat</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Store"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Formato: Bar, Drive-through o Kiosk.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>formato</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Certification_CertScheme">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>CertScheme</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Certification"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Schema di certificazione e audit applicato.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>schema</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Shipment_Carrier">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>Carrier</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Shipment"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Corriere.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>corriere</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>vettore</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/PackagingRun">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>PackagingRun</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Un ciclo di confezionamento: è il «lotto» nel linguaggio della logistica, quello stampato sulla busta. Ogni PackagingRun confeziona caffè di un solo RoastBatch.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>packaging run</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>lotto di confezionamento</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>confezionamento</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>lotto busta</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Equipment">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Equipment</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Una macchina espresso installata in un negozio. Ha due proprietà time series dalla telemetria: PumpPressureBar (normale tra 8,5 e 9,5 bar; sotto 8,5 bar l'espresso è sottoestratto e risulta acido) e BoilerTempC (normale tra 90 e 96 °C; sotto 90 °C il caffè risulta acido).</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>macchina</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>macchina espresso</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>macchina del caffè</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>attrezzatura</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>asset</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/PackagingRun_PackagingLine">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>PackagingLine</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/PackagingRun"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Linea di confezionamento.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>linea</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/GreenLot_WarehouseStatus">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>WarehouseStatus</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/GreenLot"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Stato in magazzino: InStock (non ancora tostato), Roasted (già tostato) o OnHold (in attesa).</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>stato magazzino</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/PackagingRun_PackagingDate">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>PackagingDate</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/PackagingRun"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Data del confezionamento.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>data confezionamento</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/GreenLot_GreenWeightKg">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>GreenWeightKg</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/GreenLot"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Peso del lotto in kg.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>peso lotto</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Farm_FarmId">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>FarmId</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Farm"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Codice univoco del produttore.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>codice farm</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>codice produttore</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/PackagingRun_BestBefore">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>BestBefore</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/PackagingRun"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Data di scadenza consigliata.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>da consumarsi preferibilmente entro</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/RoastBatch_packedInto_PackagingRun">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>packedInto</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/RoastBatch"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/PackagingRun"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Il RoastBatch è stato confezionato in questo PackagingRun.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>confezionato in</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/PackagingRun_BagsProduced">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>BagsProduced</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/PackagingRun"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Numero di buste da 1 kg prodotte.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>buste prodotte</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Shipment_BagsShipped">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>BagsShipped</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Shipment"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Numero di buste spedite.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>buste spedite</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Certification_CertStatus">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>CertStatus</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Certification"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Stato attuale: Active, Suspended o Expired.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>stato certificazione</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Store">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label>Store</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Un punto vendita Fourth Coffee (la quarta mano: il cliente beve qui). Lo stesso negozio si chiama StoreId nell'anagrafica, store_id nel registro dispositivi e destination_id nelle spedizioni: sono lo stesso codice.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>negozio</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>punto vendita</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>caffetteria</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>bar</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>outlet</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>drive-through</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>store</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/GreenLot_roastedInto_RoastBatch">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>roastedInto</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/GreenLot"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/RoastBatch"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Il GreenLot è stato tostato in questo RoastBatch.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>tostato in</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Equipment_BoilerTempC">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>BoilerTempC</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Equipment"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Temperatura della caldaia in °C (time series). Normale: 90-96 °C.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>temperatura caldaia</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>temperatura acqua</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Store_OpenedOn">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
    <rdfs:label>OpenedOn</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/Store"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime"/>
    <rdfs:comment>Data di apertura.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:altLabel>data apertura</skos:altLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://fourthcoffee.example/ontology/GreenLot_PurchaseDate">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"/>
